# D-yaw: yaw rate-loop multisine, two 30 s passes (0.5-15 Hz, 60 deg/s = the yaw cap, excitation.AMP_MAX_DPS),
# same set-up as lab_d_excite (MRAC injection off, default PID gains, fusion 2). Two passes give the repeat for the
# coherence / variance check. All values PROPOSED, none measured. Then on the ground:
# python -m ground_station.autotune.cli <session> --axis yaw. Plan: docs/lab/2026-10-24-prep-report.md
campaign lab-d-excite-yaw
# rate 200 = the ceiling: in SUBSCRIBE_ONLY the firmware stream ticks at 200 Hz (SEND_TASK_HZ, campaign_capture.py:353);
# 13x the 15 Hz top line. Lab mode keeps it (campaign_live.keeps_full_rate); no live probe yet. thrust_model adds
# u_gyrox/u_gyroy/u_gyroz (rate PID output = Uc for the frequency response); the core set has gyro PID .FB/.Des + motors.
rate 200
log velocity_loops camera_fusion thrust_model sysid
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10
takeoff 0.5 mrac_injection=0
hold 8
excite axis=yaw signal=multisine f0=0.5 f1=15 amp=60 duration_s=30
hold 3
excite axis=yaw signal=multisine f0=0.5 f1=15 amp=60 duration_s=30
hold 3
land
